  "scope": [
    "Derive an offline, reproducible breakdown of retained Wave 5A Token, latency, cache, quality, and intervention observations without inferring unmeasured billing or causality.",
    "Define and implement a Wave 5B evaluator access protocol that freezes arm-neutral scores before the coordinator mapping is joined and fails closed when separation evidence is absent.",
    "Update the human validation record with evidence-backed conclusions and an explicit model-backed execution boundary; do not start a provider turn."
  ],
  "acceptance_criteria": [
    "A deterministic command regenerates the analysis from retained repository evidence and reproduces the published totals and qualified-pair deltas.",
    "The Wave 5B preflight verifies arm-neutral input manifests, frozen-score-before-unseal ordering, and rejects leaked mapping or unproven evaluator separation.",
    "Claims distinguish observed association from causal explanation, gross throughput from operational Tokens, and both from billed cost."
  ],
